# Operator-identity tokens for the tracked-file PII scanner.
#
# Copy this file to `operator-identity.txt` (same directory) and fill in your
# own identity tokens. `operator-identity.txt` is GITIGNORED so your real name
# never lands in tracked source — the trunk stays shareable.
#
# Format: one regex token per line. Blank lines and `#`-comment lines are
# ignored. Each line is compiled as a Python regex (re.DOTALL).
#
# Example (replace with your own name):
# YourFirstName|YourLastName
